{"signature": "{\"text\": \"To calculate dissipated energy, write down the total input, add the stated useful outputs and subtract them from the input. For example, suppose a device receives 100 joules of energy and transfers 45 joules by light and 36 joules by sound. If these are the only useful outputs, their total is 81 joules. Subtract 81 from 100 to obtain 19 joules dissipated to the surroundings. In a real mobile phone, whether sound or light is useful depends on what the phone is being used for.\", \"voice\": \"en-NG-AbeoNeural\", \"rate\": \"-4%\", \"eleven\": false}", "duration": 33.336, "words": [["To", 0.102083], ["calculate", 0.284375], ["dissipated", 0.766166], ["energy,", 1.352083], ["write", 2.146375], ["down", 2.406791], ["the", 2.628125], ["total", 2.745333], ["input,", 3.083875], ["add", 3.839083], ["the", 3.995333], ["stated", 4.086458], ["useful", 4.503125], ["outputs", 4.919791], ["and", 5.50575], ["subtract", 5.648958], ["them", 6.156791], ["from", 6.326041], ["the", 6.573458], ["input.", 6.716666], ["For", 8.203125], ["example,", 8.4245], ["suppose", 9.231791], ["a", 9.635416], ["device", 9.739583], ["receives", 10.117208], ["100", 10.546875], ["joules", 11.171875], ["of", 11.497416], ["energy", 11.679708], ["and", 12.070333], ["transfers", 12.252625], ["45", 12.747416], ["joules", 13.359375], ["by", 13.723958], ["light", 13.854166], ["and", 14.114583], ["36", 14.322916], ["joules", 14.960958], ["by", 15.325541], ["sound.", 15.507833], ["If", 16.822916], ["these", 17.070333], ["are", 17.265625], ["the", 17.408875], ["only", 17.565125], ["useful", 17.864583], ["outputs,", 18.203125], ["their", 19.0625], ["total", 19.257833], ["is", 19.609375], ["81", 19.726583], ["joules.", 20.260416], ["Subtract", 21.692708], ["81", 22.278666], ["from", 22.747416], ["100", 23.007833], ["to", 23.567708], ["obtain", 23.710958], ["19", 24.036458], ["joules", 24.492208], ["dissipated", 24.83075], ["to", 25.390625], ["the", 25.520833], ["surroundings.", 25.612], ["